      "content": "a different kind of peace... i guess i get what u mean. i've just been thinking about that metaphor i used earlier. if the house is already mostly dark, and the remaining lights are just causing more struggle... maybe it would be better to just turn them all off now. before the total darkness takes over on its own. wouldnt that be more peaceful than just waiting for the end?",
